apshot\",\r\n  \"记录本次运行的内存状态，供排查使用。生成时应用可能短暂暂停。\": \"Record the memory status of this run for troubleshooting purposes. The application may pause briefly while building.\",\r\n  \"清除记录并关闭\": \"clear record and close\",\r\n  \"导出诊断包\": \"Export diagnostic package\",\r\n  \"继续使用\": \"continue to use\",\r\n  \"关键字\": \"Keywords\",\r\n  \"清除已保存的异常标记；日志和转储文件会保留。\": \"Clears saved exception flags; logs and dump files are retained.\",\r\n  \"花\": \"flower\",\r\n  \"复制报告\": \"Copy report\",\r\n  \"第\": \"No.\",\r\n  \"轮 ·\": \"wheel ·\",\r\n  \"轮到你了，请输入含有关键字的诗句\": \"It's your turn, please enter a poem containing keywords\",\r\n  \"人在场\": \"people present\",\r\n  \"诗句记录\": \"verse record\",\r\n  \"输入诗句...\": \"Enter a poem...\",\r\n  \"认输\": \"admit defeat\",\r\n  \"是否猜人物\": \"Whether to guess the character\",\r\n  \"剩余猜测\": \"remaining guesses\",\r\n  \"已提问\": \"Asked\",\r\n  \"人物类别\": \"Character category\",\r\n  \"问答记录\": \"Q&A record\",\r\n  \"提出一个可以用\\\"是/否\\\"回答的问题\": \"Ask a question that can be answered with a yes/no answer\",\r\n  \"提问\": \"Ask a question\",\r\n  \"猜测\": \"guess\",\r\n  \"AI 已想好一位人物，请提出\\\"是/否\\\"问题来缩小范围\": \"The AI ​​has a character in mind, please ask a yes/no question to narrow it down\",\r\n  \"例如：这位人物是真实存在的历史人物吗？\": \"For example: Is this character a real historical figure?\",\r\n  \"请输入你猜测的人物姓名，确认后将判定胜负\": \"Please enter the name of the character you guessed, and the winner will be determined after confirmation.\",\r\n  \"输入人物姓名...\": \"Enter the person's name...\",\r\n  \"确认猜测\": \"confirm guess\",\r\n  \"成语接龙\": \"Idiom Solitaire\",\r\n  \"当前需接字\": \"Need to pick up words currently\",\r\n  \"返回提问\": \"Return to question\",\r\n  \"轮\": \"wheel\",\r\n  \"轮到你了，请输入成语\": \"It's your turn, please enter an idiom\",\r\n  \"成语记录\": \"Idiom record\",\r\n  \"输入四字成语...\": \"Enter the four-character idiom...\",\r\n  \"屏幕软键盘 (F8)\": \"On-screen soft keyboard (F8)\",\r\n  \"触发\": \"trigger\",\r\n  \"待办\": \"To-do\",\r\n  \"今日预算使用情况\": \"Today’s budget usage\",\r\n  \"搜索聊天记录（Ctrl+F）\": \"Search chat history (Ctrl+F)\",\r\n  \"当前会话消费（USD）\": \"Current session consumption (USD)\",\r\n  \"语音输入\": \"Voice input\",\r\n  \"显示终端（Ctrl+T）\": \"Show terminal (Ctrl+T)\",\r\n  \"画布\": \"canvas\",\r\n  \"下载管理（Ctrl+D）\": \"Download management (Ctrl+D)\",\r\n  \"输入值或公式（如 =SUM(A1:A10)）\": \"Enter a value or formula (such as =SUM(A1:A10))\",\r\n  \"搜索历史（Ctrl+F）...\": \"Search history (Ctrl+F)...\",\r\n  \"扩展\": \"Expand\",\r\n  \"源代码管理\": \"Source code management\",\r\n  \"数据表格\": \"data table\",\r\n  \"显示或收起 AI 侧栏\": \"Show or collapse the AI ​​sidebar\",\r\n  \"正在启动桌面工作台…\": \"Starting desktop workbench...\",\r\n  \"重试\": \"Try again\",\r\n  \"沉浸模式\": \"immersive mode\",\r\n  \"新建 Code 会话\": \"Create a new Code session\",\r\n  \"编程 AI 助手\": \"Programming AI assistants\",\r\n  \"调整 AI 侧栏宽度\": \"Adjust AI sidebar width\",\r\n  \"AI 对话\": \"AI conversation\",\r\n  \"描述需求，或在编辑器中选中代码。AI 会结合当前工作区帮你修改、测试和审查。\": \"Describe the requirements, or select the code in the editor. AI will help you revise, test and review based on the current workspace.\",\r\n  \"一起完成编程任务\": \"Complete programming tasks together\",\r\n  \"今日预算\": \"today's budget\",\r\n  \"AI 修改\": \"AI modification\",\r\n  \"附带当前编辑器上下文\": \"Comes with current editor context\",\r\n  \"暂无待审阅的修改\": \"There are no changes pending review\",\r\n  \"描述编程任务… Enter 发送，Shift+Enter 换行\": \"Describe programming tasks... Enter to send, Shift+Enter to wrap\",\r\n  \"编程任务\": \"Programming tasks\",\r\n  \"使用当前模型与工具\": \"Use current models and tools\",\r\n  \"搜索 Code 历史（Ctrl+F）...\": \"Search Code History (Ctrl+F)...\",\r\n  \"停止任务\": \"Stop task\",\r\n  \"发送任务\": \"Send task\",\r\n  \"搜索 Babe 历史（Ctrl+F）...\": \"Search Babe History (Ctrl+F)...\",\r\n  \"以下工具在 AI 首次调用时会请求授权；授权后可在此撤销。\": \"The following tools request authorization when the AI ​​is first called; authorization can be revoked here.\",\r\n  \"工具授权状态\": \"Tool authorization status\",\r\n  \"电脑控制权限检测\": \"Computer control authority detection\",\r\n  \"工具组\": \"tool set\",\r\n  \"全部开\": \"All open\",\r\n  \"全部关\": \"All off\",\r\n  \"新建任务\": \"Create new task\",\r\n  \"自动化任务：定时、系统通知或 HTTP 信号触发后，用 DSL 构造提示词并新建一个 Chat 会话发送。\": \"Automated tasks: After timing, system notification or HTTP signal is triggered, use DSL to construct prompt words and create a new Chat session to send.\",\r\n  \"刷新 MCP 工具\": \"Refresh MCP tools\",\r\n  \"暂无自动化任务\": \"There are currently no automated tasks\",\r\n  \"字段修改后自动保存\": \"Automatically save after field modification\",\r\n  \"设置分类\": \"Set categories\",\r\n  \"搜索设置、功能或关键词（Ctrl/Cmd+F）\": \"Search settings, features or keywords (Ctrl/Cmd+F)\",\r\n  \"设置概览\": \"Settings overview\",\r\n  \"助手与个性化\": \"Assistants and personalization\",\r\n  \"模型与连接\": \"Models and connections\",\r\n  \"模型与智能\": \"Models and intelligence\",\r\n  \"System One 决策模型\": \"System One decision model\",\r\n  \"Token 与上下文\": \"Token and context\",\r\n  \"用量与成本\": \"Usage and cost\",\r\n  \"消费与用量上限\": \"Consumption and usage limits\",\r\n  \"字体\": \"font\",\r\n  \"语音\": \"voice\",\r\n  \"输入法\": \"input method\",\r\n  \"外观与语言\": \"appearance and language\",\r\n  \"语音与输入\": \"Voice and input\",\r\n  \"工具执行权限\": \"Tool execution permissions\",\r\n  \"自动化与执行\": \"Automation and Execution\",\r\n  \"连接与集成\": \"Connect and Integrate\",\r\n  \"维护\": \"maintain\",\r\n  \"环境检测\": \"Environmental testing\",\r\n  \"系统与安全\": \"Systems and Security\",\r\n  \"本机与虚拟机\": \"Native vs. virtual machine\",\r\n  \"常用设置\": \"Common settings\",\r\n  \"限额分别控制什么\": \"What do the limits control?\",\r\n  \"从这里查看配置状态，或搜索具体设置。普通字段修改后自动保存；连接、安装和维护操作使用各页按钮。\": \"View configuration status from here, or search for specific settings. Normal fields are automatically saved after modification; use buttons on each page for connection, installation and maintenance operations.\",\r\n  \"单次请求容量、输出预留、工具加载和历史压缩。\": \"Single request capacity, output reservation, tool loading, and history compression.\",\r\n  \"每天累计 Token、生成图片张数、System One 调用次数，以及按价格表估算的日／周／月 LLM 费用。\": \"The daily accumulated Tokens, number of generated images, number of System One calls, and estimated daily/weekly/monthly LLM fees based on the price list.\",\r\n  \"只作用于当前目标任务，在任务界面设置，保留独立的任务范围。\": \"It only affects the current target task and is set in the task interface, retaining an independent task scope.\",\r\n  \"任务目标预算\": \"mission target budget\",\r\n  \"调整 Token 分配\": \"Adjust Token Allocation\",\r\n  \"调整累计限额\": \"Adjust cumulative limit\",\r\n  \"头像框\": \"Avatar frame\",\r\n  \"Babe 头像\": \"Babe avatar\",\r\n  \"给TA起个名字...\": \"Give him a name...\",\r\n  \"Babe 头像框\": \"Babe avatar frame\",\r\n  \"手动切换。\": \"Manual switching.\",\r\n  \"TA 会定时主动找你聊天（应用打开时即生效，无需停留在 Babe 模式）\": \"TA will take the initiative to chat with you regularly (it will take effect when the app is opened, no need to stay in Babe mode)\",\r\n  \"会话创建时按下方策略选定一个模型并锁定到该会话，之后不再自动切换（保护提示词缓存）；仅可用\": \"When creating a session, press the following strategy to select a model and lock it to the session. It will no longer automatically switch after that (protect the prompt word cache); only available\",\r\n  \"System One 决策需先在「决策模型」标签页启用；失败时回退到条目手动值\": \"System One decision-making needs to be enabled in the \\\"Decision Model\\\" tab first; if it fails, it will fall back to the manual value of the entry.\",\r\n  \"OpenCode Go (订阅)\": \"OpenCode Go (subscription)\",\r\n  \"OpenAI Responses（新版）\": \"OpenAI Responses (new version)\",\r\n  \"搜索模型…\": \"Search for models…\",\r\n  \"获取。Zen：按量付费，含限时免费模型（可点「生成新 Key」免登录，key=public）；Go：需先在 opencode.ai 订阅后粘贴同一 Key\": \"Get. Zen: Pay as you go, including limited-time free models (you can click \\\"Generate New Key\\\" to avoid logging in, key=public); Go: You need to subscribe to opencode.ai first and then paste the same Key\",\r\n  \"OpenAI兼容：标准 chat/completions；OpenAI Responses：新版 /v1/responses；Anthropic兼容：messages API；OpenCode Zen：免费/按量；OpenCode Go：$10/月订阅，按模型自动路由端点\": \"OpenAI compatible: standard chat/completions; OpenAI Responses: new version /v1/responses; Anthropic compatible: messages API; OpenCode Zen: free/measured; OpenCode Go: $10/month subscription, automatically routing endpoints by model\",\r\n  \"OpenCode 官方将限时免费模型的容量保留给官方客户端 —— 官方网关按\": \"OpenCode officially reserves the capacity of the limited-time free model to the official client - official gateway button\",\r\n  \"OpenCode API Key（Zen / Go 通用）\": \"OpenCode API Key (common to Zen/Go)\",\r\n  \"免费模型官方方案说明：\": \"Free model official plan description:\",\r\n  \"。若想使用免费模型，需你自行在下方「自定义请求头」中添加一条\": \". If you want to use the free model, you need to add a custom request header below.\",\r\n  \"校验请求，本应用\": \"Verification request, this application\",\r\n  \"不会自动替你伪装\": \"I won’t automatically disguise myself for you\",\r\n  \"风险须知：\": \"Risk information:\",\r\n  \"（可点击右侧按钮代为填入草稿）。\": \"(You can click the button on the right to fill in the draft on your behalf).\",\r\n  \"该门控属于官方反滥用措施，规则随时可能变化；一旦官方收紧策略，免费模型可能失效、你的账号或 IP 可能被限流。是否添加由你自行决定并承担相应后果。不添加也可正常使用 Zen 付费模型 / Go 订阅模型。\": \"This gate control is an official anti-abuse measure and the rules may change at any time; once the official tightens the policy, the free model may become invalid and your account or IP may be restricted. It is up to you to decide whether to add it and bear the corresponding consequences. You can use the Zen paid model / Go subscription model normally without adding it.\",\r\n  \"无法自动识别模型是否支持多模态时（如 llama.cpp 本地模型），可强制开启以允许读取图片直接注入上下文\": \"When it is impossible to automatically identify whether the model supports multi-modality (such as the llama.cpp local model), it can be forced to open to allow the image to be read and directly injected into the context.\",\r\n  \"在自定义请求头中添加官方 UA\": \"Add official UA in custom request headers\",\r\n  \"多模态视觉输入 (强制启用)\": \"Multimodal visual input (mandatory enabled)\",\r\n  \"复制主 Agent 的 API URL / Key / Provider 设置\": \"Copy the API URL/Key/Provider settings of the master Agent\",\r\n  \"外置视觉 API（纯文本模型的眼睛）\": \"External Vision API (eyes for plain text models)\",\r\n  \"当主模型不支持多模态时，通过独立配置的视觉模型描述图片。需在价格表中添加该 VLM 模型方可计入预算。留空禁用。\": \"When the main model does not support multi-modality, the image is described through an independently configured visual model. This VLM model needs to be added to the price list to be included in the budget. Leave blank to disable.\",\r\n  \"模型名，如 gpt-4o-mini / qwen-vl-plus\": \"Model name, such as gpt-4o-mini / qwen-vl-plus\",\r\n  \"-- 选择模型 --\": \"-- Select model --\",\r\n  \"对齐主 Agent\": \"Align Master Agent\",\r\n  \"推理强度 / 变体\": \"Reasoning Strength/Variation\",\r\n  \"自动附加 OpenCode 会话头\": \"Automatically append OpenCode session headers\",\r\n  \"自定义请求头 (对所有文本/VLM 请求生效)\": \"Custom request headers (effective for all text/VLM requests)\",\r\n  \"URL 命中 opencode.ai 时自动发送 x-opencode-session/request/project 等身份头（官方 ID 形状：ses_/msg_ + 12 位十六进制 + 14 位 base62；Go 订阅与免费模型池均会校验）。免费模型所需的 User-Agent 不会自动注入——见下方免费模型说明，由你决定是否添加\": \"When the URL hits opencode.ai, identity headers such as x-opencode-session/request/project are automatically sent (official ID shape: ses_/msg_ + 12-digit hexadecimal + 14-digit base62; both Go subscription and free model pool will be verified). The User-Agent required by the free model is not automatically injected - see the free model description below, it is up to you to add it\",\r\n  \"添加请求头\": \"Add request header\",\r\n  \"档位随当前模型能力动态变化；切换模型后会自动收敛到该模型支持的档位\": \"The gear changes dynamically with the capabilities of the current model; after switching models, it will automatically converge to the gear supported by the model.\",\r\n  \"OpenCode Zen（免费 System One 1.13）\": \"OpenCode Zen (Free System One 1.13)\",\r\n  \"自定义头优先级最高，可覆盖自动头（如手动指定 User-Agent）。保存后立即对下次请求生效\": \"Custom headers have the highest priority and can override automatic headers (such as manually specifying User-Agent). After saving, it will take effect immediately for the next request.\",\r\n  \"System One 不生成文本，只做「选择 / 打分 / 是否」类快速决策（70–500ms），用于模型池选型、工具选择、命令护栏、游戏决策等。低置信一律回退原有逻辑，不会阻塞主流程。\": \"System One does not generate text, but only makes quick decisions (70-500ms) such as \\\"select/score/whether\\\", which is used for model pool selection, tool selection, command guardrails, game decisions, etc. Low confidence will always roll back to the original logic and will not block the main process.\",\r\n  \"留空使用默认地址\": \"Leave blank to use default address\",\r\n  \"Zen 免费可留空（public）；TypeSafe 必填\": \"Zen is free and can be left blank (public); TypeSafe is required\",\r\n  \"TypeSafe 直连（自备 Key）\": \"TypeSafe direct connection (bring your own Key)\",\r\n  \"危险命令判断等保守场景：概率达到该值才判定为「危险 / 需要确认」\": \"Conservative scenarios such as dangerous command judgment: only when the probability reaches this value is it judged as \\\"dangerous/requires confirmation\\\"\",\r\n  \"默认 jev-1.13-free（Zen）/ jev-latest（TypeSafe）\": \"Default jev-1.13-free (Zen)/jev-latest (TypeSafe)\",\r\n  \"choice/score 低于该置信度 → 回退原有逻辑\": \"choice/score is lower than the confidence level → roll back the original logic\",\r\n  \"超时 (ms)\": \"timeout (ms)\",\r\n  \"关闭可避免把邮件内容发送给决策服务（隐私）\": \"Turn off to avoid sending email content to decision services (Privacy)\",\r\n  \"上下文是单次请求的总容量；输出、工具定义和对话共用这份空间。每日累计用量与美元限额请到「消费与用量上限」。\": \"The context is the total capacity of a single request; output, tool definitions, and conversations share this space. For the daily accumulated usage and USD limit, please go to \\\"Consumption and Usage Limits\\\".\",\r\n  \"Token 分配\": \"Token distribution\",\r\n  \"模型一次请求能容纳的输入与输出总量。模型池条目可配置各自容量；会话使用自己选中模型的容量。\": \"The total amount of input and output that the model can accommodate in one request. Model pool entries can be configured with their own capacity; sessions use the capacity of their own selected models.\",\r\n  \"默认模型上下文容量（tokens）\": \"Default model context capacity (tokens)\",\r\n  \"控制每次请求最多生成多少 token，支持时包含思考 token。输出空间会从上下文中预留，实际上限以当前模型容量为准。\": \"Controls the maximum number of tokens generated for each request, including think tokens when supported. Output space is reserved from the context, and the actual upper limit is based on the current model capacity.\",\r\n  \"按需加载工具\": \"Load tools on demand\",\r\n  \"单次输出上限（tokens）\": \"Single output upper limit (tokens)\",\r\n  \"常用工具保持加载，其余工具通过本地搜索补充，内置、MCP 和插件能力均可发现。\": \"Frequently used tools stay loaded, and the rest are supplemented by local searches, discoverable in built-in, MCP, and plug-in capabilities.\",\r\n  \"System One 根据任务选择工具；未启用 System One 的工具选择或服务不可用时使用本地候选。与按需加载可同时开启。\": \"System One selects tools based on the task; local candidates are used when System One-enabled tool selection is not available or when the service is unavailable. Can be enabled at the same time as on-demand loading.\",\r\n  \"工具定义占用上限（估算 tokens）\": \"Tool definition occupancy upper limit (estimated tokens)\",\r\n  \"自动选择预加载工具（System One 优先）\": \"Automatic selection of preloading tools (System One preferred)\",\r\n  \"上下文压缩\": \"Context compression\",\r\n  \"管理启用的工具\": \"Manage enabled tools\",\r\n  \"自动压缩\": \"automatic compression\",\r\n  \"属于上下文的一部分，默认最多 4000；小窗口还会按可用输入空间收敛。完整加载模式不使用该上限。\": \"Part of the context, defaults to up to 4000; small windows also converge to the available input space. Full load mode does not use this cap.\",\r\n  \"输入包络（系统提示词 + 工具定义 + 对话 + 输出预留）占上下文窗口的比例\": \"Proportion of the input envelope (system prompt words + tool definitions + dialogue + output reservations) to the context window\",\r\n  \"上下文占用超过阈值时自动压缩（剪枝 + 结构化摘要检查点）\": \"Automatic compression (pruning + structured summary checkpoint) when context usage exceeds threshold\",\r\n  \"开始压缩的占用比例\": \"Occupancy ratio to start compression\",\r\n  \"摘要重试次数\": \"Summary retries\",\r\n  \"保留最近对话比例\": \"Keep proportion of recent conversations\",\r\n  \"单次压缩摘要上限（tokens）\": \"Single compression digest upper limit (tokens)\",\r\n  \"最近对话原样保留的 token 预算（占窗口比例），压缩只动更早的历史\": \"The token budget (in proportion to the window) of the most recent conversations is kept intact, and compression only moves the earlier history.\",\r\n  \"摘要未收敛（没有明显缩短）时的额外重试次数\": \"Number of additional retries when the digest does not converge (not shorten significantly)\",\r\n  \"单次摘要请求的最大输出 token（八段式结构化检查点）\": \"Maximum output token for a single digest request (eight-segment structured checkpoint)\",\r\n  \"对当前模式会话手动执行一次压缩\": \"Manually perform a compaction on the current mode session\",\r\n  \"立即压缩\": \"Compress now\",\r\n  \"厂商预设\": \"Factory default\",\r\n  \"图像尺寸 / 宽高比\": \"Image size / aspect ratio\",\r\n  \"sk-...（本地端点可留空）\": \"sk-... (local endpoint can be left blank)\",\r\n  \"生成数量\": \"Generate quantity\",\r\n  \"选择厂商后自动填充端点与推荐模型，均可手动修改\": \"After selecting the manufacturer, the endpoints and recommended models are automatically populated and can be modified manually.\",\r\n  \"部分模型/端点仅支持 1 张\": \"Some models/endpoints only support 1 image\",\r\n  \"Gemini/Imagen/Stability 会自动换算为对应的 aspectRatio\": \"Gemini/Imagen/Stability will be automatically converted to the corresponding aspectRatio\",\r\n  \"高级参数（按厂商生效，留空用默认）\": \"Advanced parameters (valid according to manufacturer, leave blank to use default)\",\r\n  \"质量 quality\": \"quality quality\",\r\n  \"输出格式\": \"Output format\",\r\n  \"背景 background\": \"background background\",\r\n  \"不要出现的元素…\": \"Elements that should not appear...\",\r\n  \"负面提示词\": \"negative cue words\",\r\n  \"种子 seed\": \"seed seed\",\r\n  \"留空随机\": \"Leave blank for random\",\r\n  \"采样步数 steps\": \"Sampling steps steps\",\r\n  \"SD 风格端点专用\": \"SD style endpoint specific\",\r\n  \"风格预设 style\": \"style preset style\",\r\n  \"引导系数 guidance\": \"guidance coefficient guidance\",\r\n  \"添加水印\": \"add watermark\",\r\n  \"火山方舟等端点生效\": \"Endpoints such as Volcano Ark take effect\",\r\n  \"占位符：{{prompt}} {{model}} {{size}} {{n}} {{seed}} {{negative_prompt}}；响应自动探测\": \"Placeholders: {{prompt}} {{model}} {{size}} {{n}} {{seed}} {{negative_prompt}}; in response to auto-detection\",\r\n  \"自定义请求头 (生图 API 生效)\": \"Custom request header (valid for raw image API)\",\r\n  \"自定义请求体 JSON 模板\": \"Custom request body JSON template\",\r\n  \"累计用量上限\": \"Cumulative usage limit\",\r\n  \"刷新用量统计\": \"Refresh usage statistics\",\r\n  \"URL 命中 opencode.ai 时同样会自动附加 OpenCode 官方请求头；自定义头优先级最高\": \"When the URL hits opencode.ai, the official OpenCode request header will also be automatically appended; the custom header has the highest priority.\",\r\n  \"每日 System One 决策调用上限（0 为不限制）\": \"Daily System One decision call limit (0 means no limit)\",\r\n  \"每日 LLM Token 用量上限\": \"Daily LLM Token usage limit\",\r\n  \"这些是每日累计限额，与单次回复长度无关。0 表示不限制；达到限额后停止相应的新请求。按下方预算时区每天重置。\": \"These are cumulative daily limits, regardless of the length of a single reply. 0 means no limit; when the limit is reached, corresponding new requests will be stopped. Press the budget time zone below to reset daily.\",\r\n  \"今日已调用: 0\": \"Called today: 0\",\r\n  \"今日计数管理\": \"Today's count management\",\r\n  \"System One 返回选择、评分或判断，按调用次数单独统计，达到后使用本地回退逻辑。\": \"System One returns selection, rating or judgment, counted separately according to the number of calls, and uses local fallback logic when reached.\",\r\n  \"Token 限额覆盖文本、外置视觉及压缩摘要；生图和 System One 分别按张数、调用次数统计。API 不返回用量时按文本估算；已发出的请求可能在结束后超过限额。\": \"The token limit covers text, external visuals and compressed summaries; raw images and System One are counted based on the number of images and the number of calls respectively. The API does not return usage estimates as text; requests made may exceed the limit after completion.\",\r\n  \"清零今日用量计数\": \"Clear today’s usage count\",\r\n  \"刷新预算控制\": \"Refresh budget control\",\r\n  \"只清零今日 Token 和图片张数计数；费用历史、日／周／月美元消费不会删除。\": \"Only today's Token and picture count will be cleared; expense history and daily/weekly/monthly dollar consumption will not be deleted.\",\r\n  \"统计周期\": \"statistical period\",\r\n  \"LLM 消费上限（USD）\": \"LLM consumption limit (USD)\",\r\n  \"日／周／月限额同时检查，超过任一周期便按下方策略处理。费用按本地价格表估算；未配置价格的模型记录 Token，金额为 0。\": \"The daily/weekly/monthly limits are checked at the same time. If the limit exceeds any period, it will be processed according to the policy below. The cost is estimated based on the local price list; models without configured prices record Token and the amount is 0.\",\r\n  \"仅提醒，继续请求\": \"Reminder only, continue requesting\",\r\n  \"达到上限后停止新请求\": \"Stop new requests after reaching limit\",\r\n  \"界面动效\": \"Interface animation\",\r\n  \"主标签页切换动画\": \"Home tab switching animation\",\r\n  \"关闭后，对话 / 历史 / 设置等主标签页切换不再播放淡入动画\": \"After closing, the fade-in animation will no longer play when switching main tabs such as Conversation/History/Settings.\",\r\n  \"为每个模型填写每 1M token 的单价（USD）。分别支持输入、缓存读取（cache read）、输出、缓存写入（cache write）。\\n                  缓存写入仅勾选 \\\"支持\\\" 的模型才会计费（如 Claude 系列）；其他模型即使有 cacheCreation token 也不计费。\\n                  上下文模态框的费用显示依赖此价格表，未填写的模型不显示费用。\": \"Fill in the unit price (USD) per 1M token for each model. Supports input, cache read, output, and cache write respectively.\\n                  Cache writing will only be billed for models that check \\\"Support\\\" (such as the Claude series); other models will not be billed even if they have a cacheCreation token.\\n                  The cost display of the contextual modal box relies on this price list, and the cost is not displayed for unfilled models.\",\r\n  \"模态框动画\": \"Modal animation\",\r\n  \"全局字体\": \"global font\",\r\n  \"关闭后，所有模态框打开 / 关闭变为瞬时切换（不再渐显渐隐）\": \"After closing, the opening/closing of all modal boxes becomes instantaneous switching (no longer fades in and out)\",\r\n  \"中文字体（zh）\": \"Chinese font (zh)\",\r\n  \"内置多款自由字体（SIL OFL 开源协议），可按语言分别配置。选择后立即全局生效；保持“系统默认”即维持当前外观。\": \"Built-in multiple free fonts (SIL OFL open source protocol), which can be configured separately by language. It will take effect globally immediately after selection; keeping \\\"System Default\\\" will maintain the current appearance.\",\r\n  \"英文字体（en）\": \"English font (en)\",\r\n  \"中文字形（含 CJK）使用该字体。\": \"Chinese glyphs (including CJK) use this font.\",\r\n  \"德文字体（de）\": \"German font (de)\",\r\n  \"语音模型未就绪\": \"Speech model not ready\",\r\n  \"拉丁字形优先使用该字体；未选择时回退到德文字体。\": \"Latin glyphs take precedence over this font; fallback to German font when not selected.\",\r\n  \"英文字体未选择时，拉丁字形（含德文变音符号 ä ö ü ß）使用该字体。\": \"When the English font is not selected, this font is used for Latin glyphs (including German diacritics ä ö ü ß).\",\r\n  \"语音输入（STT）\": \"Voice input (STT)\",\r\n  \"前往资源下载\": \"Go to resource download\",\r\n  \"语音识别\": \"speech recognition\",\r\n  \"识别模型\": \"Identify model\",\r\n  \"请先在「资源下载」中下载语音模型，下载完成前语音设置不可用。\": \"Please download the voice model in \\\"Resource Download\\\" first. The voice settings will not be available until the download is completed.\",\r\n  \"base（更准，推荐）\": \"base (more accurate, recommended)\",\r\n  \"tiny（更快，省内存）\": \"tiny (faster, saves memory)\",\r\n  \"例如：发送、发（留空关闭）\": \"For example: send, send (leave blank to close)\",\r\n  \"发音尾词即发送\": \"Pronounce the last word and send it\",\r\n  \"听写结束语包含这些词（逗号分隔）时，自动发送该条消息并去掉关键词\": \"When the dictation conclusion contains these words (separated by commas), the message will be automatically sent and the keywords will be removed.\",\r\n  \"语音朗读（TTS）\": \"Reading to Voice (TTS)\",\r\n  \"切换后下次语音识别时生效；主窗口听写与后台唤醒框共用此模型\": \"It will take effect the next time speech recognition is performed after switching; the main window dictation and the background wake-up box share this model.\",\r\n  \"语音朗读\": \"Voice reading\",\r\n  \"AI 流式输出时实时朗读，无需等待完成\": \"AI reads in real time while streaming output, no need to wait for completion\",\r\n  \"自动检测\": \"Automatic detection\",\r\n  \"中文\": \"Chinese\",\r\n  \"自动朗读 AI 回复\": \"Automatically read AI replies aloud\",\r\n  \"朗读语言\": \"read language\",\r\n  \"小北\": \"Xiaobei\",\r\n  \"小妮\": \"Xiaoni\",\r\n  \"晓晓 (女声)\": \"Xiaoxiao (female voice)\",\r\n  \"中文音色\": \"Chinese timbre\",\r\n  \"小伊\": \"Xiao Yi\",\r\n  \"云建 (男声)\": \"Yun Jian (male voice)\",\r\n  \"云希\": \"Yunxi\",\r\n  \"英文音色\": \"English timbre\",\r\n  \"Bella (美·女声)\": \"Bella (beautiful female voice)\",\r\n  \"Heart (美·女声)\": \"Heart (Beauty·Female Voice)\",\r\n  \"Nicole (美·女声)\": \"Nicole (beautiful female voice)\",\r\n  \"Emma (英·女声)\": \"Emma (English female voice)\",\r\n  \"Lewis (英·男声)\": \"Lewis (English male voice)\",\r\n  \"语速\": \"speaking speed\",\r\n  \"音量\": \"volume\",\r\n  \"长文本自动分块\": \"Automatically divide long text into chunks\",\r\n  \"Michael (美·男声)\": \"Michael (American male voice)\",\r\n  \"长文本自动切成小块合成，防止单次合成占用过多内存导致 OOM\": \"Long text is automatically cut into small pieces for synthesis to prevent a single synthesis from taking up too much memory and causing OOM\",\r\n  \"120字\": \"120 words\",\r\n  \"试听短句\": \"Listen to short sentences\",\r\n  \"每块字数\": \"Number of words per block\",\r\n  \"使用当前音色朗读测试文本\": \"Speak test text using current voice\",\r\n  \"启用语音唤醒\": \"Enable voice wake-up\",\r\n  \"后台唤醒\": \"Wake up in the background\",\r\n  \"输入唤醒词…\": \"Enter wake word…\",\r\n  \"唤醒词列表\": \"wake word list\",\r\n  \"弹出主窗口\": \"Pop up main window\",\r\n  \"弹语音条\": \"Play voice bar\",\r\n  \"添加\": \"Add to\",\r\n  \"常驻麦克风监听，约占用 1~3% CPU\": \"Resident microphone monitoring, occupying about 1~3% CPU\",\r\n  \"快捷键\": \"shortcut key\",\r\n  \"检测灵敏度\": \"Detection sensitivity\",\r\n  \"录制\": \"Record\",\r\n  \"全局热键\": \"Global hotkeys\",\r\n  \"模型状态\": \"Model status\",\r\n  \"检查中…\": \"Checking…\",\r\n  \"刷新状态\": \"refresh status\",\r\n  \"按此组合键开关听写\": \"Press this key combination to turn dictation on and off\",\r\n  \"屏幕软键盘 / 输入法\": \"On-screen soft keyboard/input method\",\r\n  \"内置屏幕软键盘，支持中文拼音（雾凇拼音词库）与英文/德文输入。\\n                  点击窗口标题栏的键盘图标或按 F8 随时开关。词库由 scripts/build-ime-dicts.js 下载生成。\": \"Built-in on-screen soft keyboard supports Chinese Pinyin (Rime Pinyin dictionary) and English/German input.\\n                  Click the keyboard icon in the window title bar or press F8 to switch it on and off at any time. The lexicon is downloaded and generated from scripts/build-ime-dicts.js.\",\r\n  \"关闭后键盘图标/F8 仍可临时打开；开启时应用启动即显示。\": \"The keyboard icon/F8 can still be temporarily opened after it is closed; it will be displayed when the application is started when it is opened.\",\r\n  \"应用启动时自动打开屏幕软键盘\": \"Automatically open the on-screen soft keyboard when the app starts\",\r\n  \"英文\": \"English\",\r\n  \"中文（拼音）\": \"Chinese (Pinyin)\",\r\n  \"默认输入模式\": \"Default input mode\",\r\n  \"德文\": \"German\",\r\n  \"候选词数量\": \"Number of candidate words\",\r\n  \"键盘不透明度\": \"keyboard opacity\",\r\n  \"发现新版本\": \"new version found\",\r\n  \"键盘整体透明度，默认不透明。\": \"The overall transparency of the keyboard, opaque by default.\",\r\n  \"控制白名单\": \"Control whitelist\",\r\n  \"自动更新检查发现新版本时提醒（「更新」页可查看详情）\": \"Automatic update check to alert you when a new version is found (details can be viewed on the \\\"Update\\\" page)\",\r\n  \"在需要您干预时发送系统桌面通知（敏感操作审批、会话完成、问卷、文件呈递等）。\\n                  关闭后所有通知都不再弹窗（但 App 内的消息提示仍会显示）。\": \"Send system desktop notifications when your intervention is required (sensitive operation approval, session completion, questionnaire, file submission, etc.).\\n                  After closing, all notifications will no longer pop up (but the message prompts in the app will still be displayed).\",\r\n  \"仅接受来自下方列表中发件人的邮件控制指令（如审批回复、命令）。其他发件人的邮件将被忽略。\\n                  留空则只接受\\\"用户邮箱地址\\\"的指令（向后兼容旧行为）。\": \"Only accept email control instructions (e.g. approval replies, commands) from senders listed below. Messages from other senders will be ignored.\\n                  Leave blank to only accept commands for \\\"user email address\\\" (backward compatibility with old behavior).\",\r\n  \"提示：邮箱地址不区分大小写；可添加多个。用户邮箱地址会自动包含在白名单内。\": \"Tip: Email addresses are not case-sensitive; you can add multiple ones. User email addresses are automatically included in the whitelist.\",\r\n  \"FediKitten 连接\": \"FediKitten connection\",\r\n  \"登录后即可让 AI 伙伴使用 FediKitten 能力\": \"After logging in, you can let your AI partners use FediKitten capabilities\",\r\n  \"连接任意 FediKitten（Mastodon 兼容）实例，让 AI 伙伴可以刷社媒、发帖、私信。登录后 token 会保存在本机，重启后保持登录状态。\": \"Connect any FediKitten (Mastodon compatible) instance to allow AI partners to browse social media, post, and send private messages. After logging in, the token will be saved on the local machine and will remain logged in after restarting.\",\r\n  \"用户名\": \"username\",\r\n  \"实例地址\": \"Instance address\",\r\n  \"你的用户名\": \"your username\",\r\n  \"密码\": \"password\",\r\n  \"登录\": \"Log in\",\r\n  \"退出\": \"quit\",\r\n  \"登录密码（仅用于登录，不会保存）\": \"Login password (only used to log in, will not be saved)\",\r\n  \"CIBYP-IM 连接\": \"CIBYP-IM connection\",\r\n  \"https://fedikitten.pages.dev 或 http://localhost:8787\": \"https://fedikitten.pages.dev or http://localhost:8787\",\r\n  \"连接 CIBYP-IM 实例（端到端加密即时通讯），让 AI 伙伴可以收发加密消息、管理群聊。密钥保存在本机，重启后保持登录与解密能力。\": \"Connect to a CIBYP-IM instance (end-to-end encrypted instant messaging), allowing AI partners to send and receive encrypted messages and manage group chats. The key is saved locally and the login and decryption capabilities are maintained after restarting.\",\r\n  \"登录后即可让 AI 伙伴使用 CIBYP-IM 能力\": \"Log in to allow AI partners to use CIBYP-IM capabilities\",\r\n  \"服务器地址\": \"Server address\",\r\n  \"主人来信\": \"Letter from master\",\r\n  \"https://cibyp-im.pages.dev 或 http://localhost:8787\": \"https://cibyp-im.pages.dev or http://localhost:8787\",\r\n  \"接管身份（作废其他设备的加密会话）\": \"Take over identity (invalidate encrypted sessions for other devices)\",\r\n  \"主人用户名\": \"Owner username\",\r\n  \"收到主人的消息时\": \"When receiving a message from the owner\",\r\n  \"创建新 Chat 会话并发送\": \"Create a new Chat conversation and send\",\r\n  \"主人（你）的 IM 用户名，如 admin\": \"IM username of the owner (you), such as admin\",\r\n  \"无反应\": \"No response\",\r\n  \"继续当前 Chat 会话（不在 Chat 或空会话则新建）\": \"Continue the current Chat session (create a new one if it is not in Chat or has an empty session)\",\r\n  \"浏览\": \"Browse\",\r\n  \"保存主人设置\": \"Save owner settings\",\r\n  \"浏览器数据\": \"Browser data\",\r\n  \"配置后，Agent 会定期检查主人发来的私聊消息，并按所选模式处理：先回 IM 确认收到，完成后通过 IM 交付结果（文本 / 文件）。\": \"After configuration, the Agent will regularly check private messages sent by the owner and process them according to the selected mode: first reply to IM to confirm receipt, and then deliver the results (text/file) via IM after completion.\",\r\n  \"持久化配置（登录一次，长期保留）\": \"Persistent configuration (log in once, retain for a long time)\",\r\n  \"数据模式（决定登录态是否保留）\": \"Data mode (determines whether login status is retained)\",\r\n  \"复制来源（需先完全退出该浏览器）\": \"Copy the source (you need to completely exit the browser first)\",\r\n  \"系统浏览器副本（导入已有登录态）\": \"Copy of system browser (import existing login state)\",\r\n  \"隔离模式（每次全新，不保留任何数据）\": \"Isolation mode (new every time, no data retained)\",\r\n  \"数据目录：应用数据目录下的\": \"Data directory: under the application data directory\",\r\n  \"复制配置到 Agent 专用目录\": \"Copy the configuration to the Agent-specific directory\",\r\n  \"。删除该目录即可重置所有登录态。\": \". Delete this directory to reset all login states.\",\r\n  \"显示模式\": \"display mode\",\r\n  \"显示右上角工作提示横幅\": \"Display the work tips banner in the upper right corner\",\r\n  \"有头模式（显示浏览器窗口）\": \"Headed mode (display browser window)\",\r\n  \"默认开启有头模式以显示浏览器窗口。关闭后将以无头模式在后台运行（无法看到浏览器）\": \"Headed mode is enabled by default to display the browser window. When closed it will run in the background in headless mode (no browser visible)\",\r\n  \"监听 127.0.0.1 本地端口，允许外部脚本（curl/网页/其他程序）POST 触发自动化任务。默认禁用：未经你主动开启，服务器不会启动\": \"Listens to the 127.0.0.1 local port, allowing external scripts (curl/webpages/other programs) to POST to trigger automated tasks. Disabled by default: the server will not start unless you actively enable it.\",\r\n  \"自动化触发\": \"Automation trigger\",\r\n  \"有头模式时在屏幕右上角显示\\\"请勿关闭浏览器\\\"横幅。无头模式始终不显示\": \"Displays a \\\"Do Not Close Browser\\\" banner in the upper right corner of the screen when in headless mode. Headless mode never displays\",\r\n  \"修改后需重启服务器生效（关闭再开启开关）\": \"After modification, you need to restart the server to take effect (turn off and on the switch)\",\r\n  \"允许无 Token 启动\": \"Allow startup without token\",\r\n  \"⚠️ 不安全：开启后，不携带 Token 的请求也会被放行（即使已配置 Token 列表），任何本机程序（包括浏览器中的网页）都能直接触发任务。仅在无其他选择时使用\": \"⚠️ Unsafe: When enabled, requests that do not carry a Token will be allowed (even if a Token list is configured), and any native program (including web pages in the browser) can directly trigger the task. Use only when there are no other options\",\r\n  \"Token 列表\": \"Token list\",\r\n  \"添加 Token\": \"Add Token\",\r\n  \"服务器状态\": \"Server status\",\r\n  \"每个 Token 可独立设置名称、有效期、允许传参与可触发的任务范围。外部调用需携带请求头\": \"Each Token can independently set the name, validity period, and allowed transfer and participation in the task range that can be triggered. External calls need to carry request headers\",\r\n  \"完全兼容 DeepSeek Harness 插件生态：插件通过 Cordis 内核加载，工具经名称/实现翻译层接入 CIBYP。插件为受信代码，安装后默认禁用，请手动启用。\": \"Fully compatible with the DeepSeek Harness plug-in ecosystem: plug-ins are loaded through the Cordis kernel, and tools are connected to CIBYP via the name/implementation translation layer. The plug-in is a trusted code and is disabled by default after installation. Please enable it manually.\",\r\n  \"DeepSeek 插件\": \"DeepSeek plugin\",\r\n  \"从本地目录安装\": \"Install from local directory\",\r\n  \"选择\": \"choose\",\r\n  \"安装\": \"Install\",\r\n  \"插件目录路径\": \"Plugin directory path\",\r\n  \"从 npm 安装\": \"Install from npm\",\r\n  \"已安装插件\": \"Plugin installed\",\r\n  \"多会话后台执行\": \"Multi-session background execution\",\r\n  \"npm 包名\": \"npm package name\",\r\n  \"从 GitHub 安装\": \"Install from GitHub\",\r\n  \"如 C:\\\\Windows\\\\System32\\\\bash.exe 或 /bin/zsh\": \"Such as C:\\\\Windows\\\\System32\\\\bash.exe or /bin/zsh\",\r\n  \"最大并发会话数\": \"Maximum number of concurrent sessions\",\r\n  \"默认模式\": \"Default mode\",\r\n  \"同时运行的会话数达到上限后，新的消息会进入排队状态。\": \"After the number of concurrently running sessions reaches the upper limit, new messages will enter the queue state.\",\r\n  \"工作区可写\": \"Workspace is writable\",\r\n  \"进程沙箱\": \"process sandbox\",\r\n  \"完全访问（不限制）\": \"Full access (no restrictions)\",\r\n  \"只读\": \"read only\",\r\n  \"约束 Agent 启动的进程（Shell/Python/Node/终端/FFmpeg）的文件写入范围；网络与进程不受限\": \"Restrict the file writing range of processes started by Agent (Shell/Python/Node/Terminal/FFmpeg); network and processes are not restricted\",\r\n  \"跟随默认\": \"follow default\",\r\n  \"Chat 模式覆盖\": \"Chat mode override\",\r\n  \"Code 模式覆盖\": \"Code mode override\",\r\n  \"Babe 模式覆盖\": \"Babe mode override\",\r\n  \"完全访问\": \"full access\",\r\n  \"后端状态\": \"backend status\",\r\n  \"拦截时确认升级\": \"Confirm upgrade when intercepting\",\r\n  \"命令被沙箱拦截或后端不可用时，弹窗确认后以完全权限重试（关闭则直接报错）\": \"When the command is intercepted by the sandbox or the backend is unavailable, a pop-up window will pop up to confirm and try again with full permissions (if closed, an error will be reported directly)\",\r\n  \"运行位置\": \"operating position\",\r\n  \"运行自检\": \"Run self-test\",\r\n  \"命令与终端运行在\": \"Command and terminal run in\",\r\n  \"虚拟机（CIBYP-VM-OS）\": \"Virtual machine (CIBYP-VM-OS)\",\r\n  \"本机（当前系统）\": \"This machine (current system)\",\r\n  \"工作区模式\": \"workspace mode\",\r\n  \"选择虚拟机后：终端、Shell / Python / Node、文件读写、文档与媒体工具、浏览器自动化全部作用于隔离的 Linux 环境；切换需要重启应用。\": \"After selecting the virtual machine: terminal, Shell/Python/Node, file reading and writing, document and media tools, and browser automation all work in the isolated Linux environment; switching requires restarting the application.\",\r\n  \"独立工作区（虚拟机内为准）\": \"Independent workspace (subject to within the virtual machine)\",\r\n  \"共享：文件留在本机，虚拟机通过\": \"Sharing: The files stay on the local machine and the virtual machine passes\",\r\n  \"共享工作区（本机为准 + 双向同步）\": \"Shared workspace (local machine + two-way synchronization)\",\r\n  \"重置虚拟机不会丢工作区\": \"Resetting a virtual machine will not lose the workspace\",\r\n  \"。独立：工作区只在虚拟机内，需要时显式导出（隔离更强）。\": \". Independent: The workspace is only within the virtual machine and is exported explicitly when needed (stronger isolation).\",\r\n  \"双向增量同步；\": \"Two-way incremental synchronization;\",\r\n  \"工作区同步\": \"Workspace synchronization\",\r\n  \"未同步\": \"Not synced\",\r\n  \"立即同步\": \"Sync now\",\r\n  \"仅拉回\": \"Pull back only\",\r\n  \"仅推送\": \"Push only\",\r\n  \"更换目录\": \"Change directory\",\r\n  \"状态\": \"state\",\r\n  \"立即重启应用\": \"Restart the app now\",\r\n  \"打开 VM 桌面\": \"Open the VM desktop\",\r\n  \"虚拟机沙盒（CIBYP-VM-OS）\": \"Virtual Machine Sandbox (CIBYP-VM-OS)\",\r\n  \"虚拟机文件管理器\": \"Virtual machine file manager\",\r\n  \"资源\": \"resource\",\r\n  \"下载 / 更新\": \"Download/Update\",\r\n  \"镜像变体\": \"Mirror variant\",\r\n  \"打开目录\": \"Open directory\",\r\n  \"自检\": \"self-test\",\r\n  \"重置虚拟机\": \"Reset virtual machine\",\r\n  \"未检测\": \"Not detected\",\r\n  \"开启 WHPX 硬件加速\": \"Turn on WHPX hardware acceleration\",\r\n  \"端口预览\": \"Port preview\",\r\n  \"未映射端口\": \"Unmapped port\",\r\n  \"VM 内端口，如 3000\": \"VM internal port, such as 3000\",\r\n  \"映射到本机\": \"Map to local\",\r\n  \"在虚拟机内下载文件\": \"Download files within the virtual machine\",\r\n  \"检查 QEMU 运行时、硬件加速（Windows: WHPX / Linux: KVM / macOS: HVF）与镜像完整性；无硬件加速时退化为软件模拟（较慢，需管理员权限开启 WHPX）。\": \"Check QEMU runtime, hardware acceleration (Windows: WHPX / Linux: KVM / macOS: HVF) and image integrity; without hardware acceleration, it degrades to software simulation (slower, administrator rights are required to enable WHPX).\",\r\n  \"下载\": \"download\",\r\n  \"虚拟机内目录\": \"Directory within the virtual machine\",\r\n  \"隐私信息保护\": \"Privacy information protection\",\r\n  \"宿主 aria2 多连接下载后自动送入虚拟机；GitHub 链接可用加速镜像\": \"The host aria2 multi-connection is automatically sent to the virtual machine after downloading; the GitHub link can be used to accelerate the image\",\r\n  \"启用后，在工具调用过程中自动过滤手机号、证件号、社保号、API Key、SSH 私钥、.env 密钥行、Tor Hidden Service 地址、git key 以及配置文件（json/yaml/config 等）中的密码，防止隐私信息进入 AI 上下文与历史记录。\": \"After enabling, the mobile phone number, ID number, social security number, API Key, SSH private key, .env key line, Tor Hidden Service address, git key, and passwords in configuration files (json/yaml/config, etc.) are automatically filtered during the tool call process to prevent private information from entering the AI ​​context and history.\",\r\n  \"启用隐私信息保护\": \"Enable privacy information protection\",\r\n  \"过滤触发器（需开启总开关后生效）\": \"Filter trigger (needs to turn on the main switch to take effect)\",\r\n  \"工具结果过滤\": \"Tool result filtering\",\r\n  \"工具参数脱敏\": \"Tool parameter desensitization\",\r\n  \"工具返回内容注入 AI 上下文前过滤\": \"Tool returns content filtered before injection into AI context\",\r\n  \"终端内容过滤\": \"Terminal content filtering\",\r\n  \"终端命令与脚本中的密钥、Token 脱敏\": \"Desensitization of keys and tokens in terminal commands and scripts\",\r\n  \"写入上下文时隐藏参数中的密码、Token、密钥\": \"Hide passwords, tokens, and keys in parameters when writing context\",\r\n  \"过滤内容类别（可单独关闭）\": \"Filter content categories (can be turned off individually)\",\r\n  \"上传附件的 OCR/提取文本过滤\": \"OCR/extract text filtering of uploaded attachments\",\r\n  \"手机号\": \"Phone number\",\r\n  \"身份证号\": \"ID number\",\r\n  \"附件文本过滤\": \"Attachment text filtering\",\r\n  \"社保号/SSN\": \"Social Security Number/SSN\",\r\n  \"SSH 私钥\": \"SSH private key\",\r\n  \"Tor 地址/密钥\": \"Tor address/key\",\r\n  \".env 密钥\": \".env key\",\r\n  \"变换逃逸检测\": \"Transform escape detection\",\r\n  \"后台托盘\": \"backstage tray\",\r\n  \"配置密码\": \"Configure password\",\r\n  \"关闭后应用将不在系统托盘显示图标，关闭窗口即退出。\": \"After closing, the application will no longer display the icon in the system tray, and it will exit when the window is closed.\",\r\n  \"启用托盘图标\": \"Enable tray icon\",\r\n  \"关闭窗口时\": \"When closing the window\",\r\n  \"每次询问\": \"Ask every time\",\r\n  \"始终后台运行\": \"Always run in the background\",\r\n  \"始终直接退出\": \"Always exit directly\",\r\n  \"点击后窗口将立即最小化到托盘，可单击托盘图标恢复。\": \"After clicking, the window will be minimized to the tray immediately and can be restored by clicking the tray icon.\",\r\n  \"\\\"每次询问\\\"将在关闭窗口时弹窗询问您的偏好。\\\"始终\\\"选项会记住选择。\": \"\\\"Ask Every time\\\" will pop up a window asking for your preferences when closing the window. The \\\"Always\\\" option remembers the selection.\",\r\n  \"网络搜索\": \"web search\",\r\n  \"默认搜索引擎\": \"Default search engine\",\r\n  \"测试：隐藏到托盘\": \"Test: hide to tray\",\r\n  \"Fusion 同时查询四个引擎、去重并按相关度排序。默认使用免登录 MCP；也可配置自己的 Provider、地址和 Key。免登录服务的可用性和限额由服务方决定。\": \"Fusion queries four engines simultaneously, deduplicates and sorts them by relevance. Login-free MCP is used by default; you can also configure your own Provider, address and Key. The availability and limits of the login-free service are determined by the service provider.\",\r\n  \"地址（留空使用默认）\": \"Address (leave blank to use default)\",\r\n  \"MCP 工具名（可选）\": \"MCP tool name (optional)\",\r\n  \"服务配置\": \"Service configuration\",\r\n  \"1. 访问\": \"1. Visit\",\r\n  \"2. 添加：\": \"2. Add:\",\r\n  \"代理即时生效（无需重启），覆盖：AI/VLM/生图请求、模型列表、网页抓取与 net:* 工具、Playwright 浏览器、aria2 下载、npm/curl 等子进程。DNS/ping/traceroute 等底层探测与 IMAP 收信始终直连。\": \"The agent takes effect immediately (no need to restart), covering: AI/VLM/generated image request, model list, web crawling and net:* tools, Playwright browser, aria2 download, npm/curl and other sub-processes. Low-level probes such as DNS/ping/traceroute are always directly connected to IMAP reception.\",\r\n  \"1. 在 Arduino IDE 中打开导出的\": \"1. Open the exported\",\r\n  \"2. Tools → Board → esp32 → 选择你的 ESP32 型号（如 ESP32 Dev Module）\": \"2. Tools → Board → esp32 → Select your ESP32 model (such as ESP32 Dev Module)\",\r\n  \"3. Tools → Board → Boards Manager → 搜索 \\\"ESP32\\\"\": \"3. Tools → Board → Boards Manager → Search for \\\"ESP32\\\"\",\r\n  \"3. Tools → Port → 选择对应的 COM 端口\": \"3. Tools → Port → Select the corresponding COM port\",\r\n  \"下载设置\": \"Download settings\",\r\n  \"4. （可选）在代码中修改 WiFi SSID 和密码\": \"4. (Optional) Modify WiFi SSID and password in code\",\r\n  \"5. 点击 Arduino IDE 顶部的 \\\"Upload\\\" 按钮（右箭头图标）\": \"5. Click the \\\"Upload\\\" button (right arrow icon) at the top of the Arduino IDE\",\r\n  \"语音模型体积较大，不再随安装包分发。模型由你手动下载，下载后即时生效、无需重启；下载引擎优先使用内置 aria2（多连接加速），不可用时自动回退普通下载。\": \"The speech model is large and no longer distributed with the installation package. You download the model manually, and it takes effect immediately after downloading, without restarting; the download engine gives priority to the built-in aria2 (multi-connection acceleration), and automatically falls back to normal download when it is unavailable.\",\r\n  \"官方源（huggingface.co）\": \"Official source (huggingface.co)\",\r\n  \"CN 镜像（hf-mirror.com，推荐国内网络）\": \"CN mirror (hf-mirror.com, recommended domestic network)\",\r\n  \"下载源\": \"Download source\",\r\n  \"模型下载目录\": \"Model download directory\",\r\n  \"选择目录\": \"Select directory\",\r\n  \"默认：程序数据目录/voice-models\": \"Default: program data directory/voice-models\",\r\n  \"唤醒词 KWS 托管在 GitHub Release，不受镜像选择影响\": \"Wake word KWS is hosted on GitHub Release and is not affected by image selection\",\r\n  \"下载全部必需模型\": \"Download all required models\",\r\n  \"默认程序数据目录；自定义目录对所有语音模型生效\": \"Default program data directory; customized directory takes effect for all speech models\",\r\n  \"必需模型合计约 440MB（VAD + KWS + Whisper base + Kokoro）\": \"The total required models are approximately 440MB (VAD + KWS + Whisper base + Kokoro)\",\r\n  \"语音模型\": \"speech model\",\r\n  \"使用说明\": \"Instructions for use\",\r\n  \"正在读取模型状态…\": \"Reading model status...\",\r\n  \"下载中断可再次点击「下载」，已完成的文件会自动跳过；aria2 支持断点续传。\": \"If the download is interrupted, you can click \\\"Download\\\" again, and the completed file will be automatically skipped; aria2 supports resumed downloads.\",\r\n  \"未下载模型时，「语音」设置页不可用，启动时会自动关闭已开启的语音开关，避免运行时报错。\": \"When the model is not downloaded, the \\\"Voice\\\" settings page is unavailable, and the enabled voice switch will be automatically turned off when starting to avoid errors when running.\",\r\n  \"模型来源：sherpa-onnx 官方发布（HuggingFace csukuangfj/* / GitHub k2-fsa）。\": \"Model source: sherpa-onnx official release (HuggingFace csukuangfj/* / GitHub k2-fsa).\",\r\n  \"开发环境检测\": \"Development environment testing\",\r\n  \"删除模型只影响当前下载目录中的文件；如果你使用自定义目录，请确保磁盘空间充足。\": \"Deleting a model only affects files in the current download directory; if you use a custom directory, make sure there is enough disk space.\",\r\n  \"重新检测\": \"Retest\",\r\n  \"检测结果\": \"Test results\",\r\n  \"点击“重新检测”开始检测\": \"Click \\\"Retest\\\" to start testing\",\r\n  \"自动更新检查\": \"Automatic update check\",\r\n  \"检测本机是否已安装 Python、Git，以及 JavaScript 运行时（Node+npm 与 Bun 任选其一）及其版本。检测不到的组件，可以让 Agent 打开一个新 Chat 会话帮你安装。\": \"Check whether Python, Git, and JavaScript runtime (choose one of Node+npm and Bun) are installed on this machine and their versions. For undetected components, the Agent can open a new Chat session to install them for you.\",\r\n  \"检查间隔\": \"Check interval\",\r\n  \"自动检查更新\": \"Automatically check for updates\",\r\n  \"每 12 小时\": \"every 12 hours\",\r\n  \"每 6 小时\": \"every 6 hours\",\r\n  \"启动后延迟检查一次，之后按下方间隔定时检查 GitHub Releases。发现新版本时通过系统通知提醒（可在「通知」中关闭）。检查失败不会打扰你。\": \"Delay the check once after startup, and then check GitHub Releases regularly at the following intervals. Get alerts through system notifications when new versions are discovered (can be turned off in \\\"Notifications\\\"). A failed check won't bother you.\",\r\n  \"每 24 小时\": \"every 24 hours\",\r\n  \"更新通道\": \"update channel\",\r\n  \"仅稳定版\": \"Stable version only\",\r\n  \"检查更新\": \"Check for updates\",\r\n  \"全部版本\": \"All versions\",\r\n  \"尚未检查\": \"Not checked yet\",\r\n  \"仅稳定版只获取正式发布版本；全部版本同时包含 alpha/beta 等预发布版本。默认仅稳定版。\": \"Only the stable version only gets the official release version; all versions also include pre-release versions such as alpha/beta. The default is stable version only.\",\r\n  \"开发\": \"develop\",\r\n  \"打开 Releases 页\": \"Open the Releases page\",\r\n  \"立即检查\": \"Check now\",\r\n  \"-内置工具\": \"-Built-in tools\",\r\n  \"搜索聊天记录...\": \"Search chat history...\",\r\n  \"上一个（Shift+Enter）\": \"Previous(Shift+Enter)\",\r\n  \"关闭（Esc）\": \"Close (Esc)\",\r\n  \"收起待办侧栏\": \"Collapse to-do sidebar\",\r\n  \"下一个（Enter）\": \"Next (Enter)\",\r\n  \"清除已完成的待办\": \"Clear completed to-dos\",\r\n  \"待办完成进度\": \"To-do completion progress\",\r\n  \"清除已完成\": \"Cleanup completed\",\r\n  \"筛选待办\": \"Filter to-do\",\r\n  \"全部\": \"all\",\r\n  \"未完成\": \"Not completed\",\r\n  \"已完成\": \"Completed\",\r\n  \"新的待办内容\": \"New to-do content\",\r\n  \"添加一个小目标…\": \"Add a small goal…\",\r\n  \"添加待办\": \"Add to-do\",\r\n  \"会话\": \"session\",\r\n  \"工作目录\": \"working directory\",\r\n  \"上下文占用（实时）\": \"Context occupancy (real time)\",\r\n  \"会话消费\": \"session consumption\",\r\n  \"缩小 (Ctrl+-)\": \"Zoom out (Ctrl+-)\",\r\n  \"任务用时\": \"Task time\",\r\n  \"适应窗口 / 100% 切换\": \"Fit window / 100% switch\",\r\n  \"打开所在文件夹\": \"Open the folder where it is located\",\r\n  \"下载到本地\": \"Download to local\",\r\n  \"放大 (Ctrl+=)\": \"Zoom in (Ctrl+=)\",\r\n  \"关闭 (Esc)\": \"Close (Esc)\",\r\n  \"OpenCode Zen (免费/按量)\": \"OpenCode Zen (free/paid)\",\r\n  \"如 Zen 免费 Big Pickle\": \"Like Zen Free Big Pickle\",\r\n  \"留空按接入方式自动（Zen/Go 自动）\": \"Leave blank to automatically press the access method (Zen/Go automatic)\",\r\n  \"如 big-pickle / gpt-image / glm-5.3-flash\": \"Such as big-pickle/gpt-image/glm-5.3-flash\",\r\n  \"Zen 免费可填 public；其他填对应 Key\": \"Zen is free and can be filled in public; other fields can be filled in corresponding Key\",\r\n  \"默认 131072\": \"Default 131072\",\r\n  \"自动 (auto)\": \"automatic\",\r\n  \"关闭 (off)\": \"off\",\r\n  \"高 (high)\": \"high\",\r\n  \"低 (low)\": \"low\",\r\n  \"中 (medium)\": \"medium\",\r\n  \"插件配置\": \"Plug-in configuration\",\r\n  \"以 JSON 编辑插件配置；\": \"Edit plugin configuration in JSON;\",\r\n  \"表示使用默认值。保存后重新加载插件并生效。\": \"Indicates using the default value. After saving, reload the plug-in and it will take effect.\",\r\n  \"插件请求授权\": \"Plug-in requests authorization\",\r\n  \"允许\": \"allow\",\r\n  \"工具：plugin\": \"Tools: plugin\",\r\n  \"工具授权\": \"Tool authorization\",\r\n  \"全局策略为「System One 决策」时此项作为回退值\": \"This is used as the fallback value when the global strategy is \\\"System One Decision\\\"\",\r\n  \"授权后将不再每次询问；可随时在设置 → 工具中撤销。\": \"You will no longer be asked every time after authorization; it can be revoked at any time in Settings → Tools.\",\r\n  \"仅本次\": \"Only this time\",\r\n  \"关闭时后台运行？\": \"Running in the background when closed?\",\r\n  \"允许并记住\": \"allow and remember\",\r\n  \"选择\\\"始终\\\"或\\\"不再\\\"后将记住您的偏好，可在设置中修改。\": \"Selecting \\\"Always\\\" or \\\"Never Again\\\" will remember your preference and can be modified in settings.\",\r\n  \"您可以关闭窗口后让应用在后台托盘继续运行（接收通知、邮件审批等），\\n          或直接退出应用。\": \"You can close the window and let the application continue to run in the background tray (receiving notifications, email approval, etc.),\\n          Or exit the app directly.\",\r\n  \"不再后台\": \"No longer in the background\",\r\n  \"始终后台\": \"Always in the background\",\r\n  \"下载管理\": \"Download management\",\r\n  \"新建终端\": \"Create a new terminal\",\r\n  \"添加下载任务\": \"Add download task\",\r\n  \"正在连接 aria2...\": \"Connecting aria2...\",\r\n  \"下载链接\": \"Download link\",\r\n  \"支持 HTTP/HTTPS/FTP/BT/磁力链接，Agent 可异步下载\": \"Supports HTTP/HTTPS/FTP/BT/magnet links, Agent can download asynchronously\",\r\n  \"HTTP/HTTPS/FTP/磁力链接 URL\": \"HTTP/HTTPS/FTP/magnet link URL\",\r\n  \"暂无下载任务\": \"No download tasks yet\",\r\n  \"文件名（可选）\": \"File name (optional)\",\r\n  \"保存目录\": \"save directory\",\r\n  \"留空则从 URL 提取\": \"Leave blank to extract from URL\",\r\n  \"添加下载\": \"Add download\",\r\n  \"正在加载历史记录\": \"Loading history\",\r\n  \"下载保存目录\": \"Download and save directory\",\r\n  \"准备加载…\": \"Ready to load…\",\r\n  \"用户形象\": \"user image\",\r\n  \"模型配置\": \"Model configuration\",\r\n  \"OpenCode Go（订阅）\": \"OpenCode Go (subscription)\",\r\n  \"正在分批渲染消息，避免界面卡顿。大历史记录可能需要数秒。\": \"Messages are being rendered in batches to avoid interface lag. Large history may take several seconds.\",\r\n  \"例如 Partner\": \"For example Partner\",\r\n  \"OpenCode 官方将限时免费模型的容量保留给官方客户端（网关按\": \"OpenCode officially reserves the capacity of the limited-time free model to the official client (gateway press\",\r\n  \"生成免登录公共 Key\": \"Generate login-free public key\",\r\n  \"，如需使用免费模型，请自行决定是否添加该请求头。\": \", if you want to use the free model, please decide whether to add this request header.\",\r\n  \"校验）。本应用\": \"check). This application\",\r\n  \"public（免登录）\": \"public (no login required)\",\r\n  \"添加官方 User-Agent 请求头\": \"Add official User-Agent request header\",\r\n  \"虚拟机文件\": \"Virtual machine files\",\r\n  \"上一级\": \"Previous level\",\r\n  \"该门控属于官方反滥用措施，规则随时可能变化；一旦官方收紧策略，免费模型可能失效，你的账号或 IP 可能被限流。是否添加由你自行决定并承担相应后果；不添加也可正常使用付费模型。\": \"This gate control is an official anti-abuse measure and the rules may change at any time; once the official tightens the policy, the free model may become invalid and your account or IP may be restricted. It is up to you to decide whether to add it and bear the corresponding consequences; you can still use the paid model normally without adding it.\",\r\n  \"前往\": \"Go to\",\r\n  \"新建文件夹\": \"Create new folder\",\r\n  \"文件夹名称\": \"folder name\",\r\n  \"新文件夹名称\": \"New folder name\",\r\n  \"创建\": \"create\",\r\n  \"当前目录\": \"current directory\",\r\n  \"文件列表\": \"file list\",\r\n  \"文件名\": \"file name\",\r\n  \"打开\": \"Open\",\r\n  \"打开/导入工程 (cipypcb/kicad_pcb/net/csv)\": \"Open/Import project (cipypcb/kicad_pcb/net/csv)\",\r\n  \"新建工程\": \"New construction\",\r\n  \"撤销 (Ctrl+Z)\": \"Undo (Ctrl+Z)\",\r\n  \"适应视图 (F)\": \"Adapt to view (F)\",\r\n  \"重做 (Ctrl+Y)\": \"Redo (Ctrl+Y)\",\r\n  \"导出\": \"Export\",\r\n  \"翻面视图 (从底层看) (B)\": \"Flip view (from bottom) (B)\",\r\n  \"原理图\": \"Schematic diagram\",\r\n  \"导出生产文件\": \"Export production files\",\r\n  \"导入网表/其他EDA文件\": \"Import netlist/other EDA files\",\r\n  \"命令行 (输入 help 查看命令) — 例: comp add R_0805 R1 20 20\": \"Command line (type help to see the command) — Example: co