 settings and adjust appearance or limits. Account and security requests open the relevant page.',\r\n  '免费渠道安全窗口': 'Free channel safety window',\r\n  '没有可用的额度重置卡': 'No usage-limit reset credits are available', 'ChatGPT 账号已变更': 'ChatGPT account changed', '此重置卡不可用或已过期': 'This reset credit is unavailable or expired', '正在处理另一个重置请求': 'Another reset request is pending',\r\n  '额度读取器不可用；请安装官方 Codex CLI，或配置 CIBYP_CODEX_BINARY': 'Quota reader unavailable. Install the official Codex CLI or set CIBYP_CODEX_BINARY',\r\n  '此账号未提供 Codex 账号标识，请在 ChatGPT 用量页查看订阅额度': 'This account did not provide a Codex account identifier. Check ChatGPT Usage for subscription limits',\r\n  '请在模型与连接设置中添加 OpenCode Go API Key': 'Add an OpenCode Go API key in Model & connection settings', 'OpenCode Go Key 无效': 'OpenCode Go key is invalid', '需要 OpenCode Go 订阅': 'OpenCode Go subscription required',\r\n});\r\nObject.assign(EN_DICT, {\r\n  'ui.settings.tui.mouse': 'Mouse interaction',\r\n  'ui.settings.tui.mouseHint': 'Click menus, position the input cursor, scroll and drag to copy. Disable to use native terminal mouse behavior; /mouse on and /mouse off also work.',\r\n});\r\nObject.assign(EN_DICT._textMap, {\r\n  'ChatGPT / Codex 账号': 'ChatGPT / Codex account',\r\n  '订阅额度': 'Subscription quotas', '刷新订阅额度': 'Refresh subscription quotas', '订阅账号': 'Subscription account',\r\n  '登录自己的 ChatGPT 账号，授权使用订阅额度。账号凭据单独保存在本机，GUI 与 TUI 共用。': 'Sign in with your ChatGPT account to authorize subscription usage. Credentials are stored separately on this device and shared by GUI and TUI.',\r\n  '已保存账号': 'Saved accounts', '尚未登录': 'Not signed in', '订阅模型': 'Subscription models',\r\n  '使用此模型': 'Use this model', '注销账号': 'Sign out', 'ChatGPT 用量管理': 'ChatGPT usage settings',\r\n  '订阅请求按账号额度计量；API 参考单价不会作为订阅实际消费。该渠道目前不支持服务端输出 Token 上限。': 'Subscription requests use account quotas. API reference prices are not subscription charges. This channel currently does not support a server-side output token cap.',\r\n  '自动获取每 1M Token 的参考单价（USD）。价格表可逐字段覆盖：留空沿用自动价格，0 表示免费，删除条目恢复自动价格。缓存写入须勾选支持；缺少价格时显示不可用。订阅仅显示 API 等效消费，不计作实际扣费。': 'Reference prices per 1M tokens (USD) are fetched automatically. Override individual fields below: leave blank for automatic pricing, enter 0 for free, or delete the row to restore defaults. Enable cache-write support explicitly. Missing prices are shown as unavailable. Subscription estimates are API equivalents, not actual charges.',\r\n  '鼠标交互': EN_DICT['ui.settings.tui.mouse'],\r\n  '点击菜单、定位输入光标、滚轮翻页和拖选复制。关闭后使用终端原生鼠标行为；也可使用 /mouse on 或 /mouse off。': EN_DICT['ui.settings.tui.mouseHint'],\r\n});\r\ni18nRegister('en', EN_DICT);\r\n\r\nObject.assign(EN_DICT, {\r\n  \"ui.update.download\": \"Download update\",\r\n  \"ui.update.install\": \"Restart to install\",\r\n  \"ui.update.later\": \"Later\",\r\n  \"ui.update.confirm\": \"Restart to install the update?\",\r\n  \"ui.update.started\": \"Checking and downloading an update; you will be notified when it is ready\",\r\n  \"ui.update.ready\": \"Update downloaded and verified. Restart to install (/update install)\",\r\n  \"ui.update.current\": \"Already up to date\",\r\n  \"ui.update.error\": \"Update failed: \",\r\n  \"ui.update.downloading\": \"Downloading update\",\r\n  \"ui.update.checking\": \"Checking for updates\",\r\n  \"ui.tui.cmd.update\": \"Download an update; restart to install when ready\",\r\n  \"ui.tui.args.update\": \"[install]\",\r\n  \"ui.tui.configNavigation\": \"Type to search · ↑↓ select · Enter open or edit · Esc back\",\r\n  \"ui.tui.configOn\": \"On\",\r\n  \"ui.tui.configOff\": \"Off\",\r\n  \"ui.tui.configItems\": \"{count} items\",\r\n  \"ui.tui.configAdd\": \"+ Add item\",\r\n  \"ui.tui.configDelete\": \"Delete this item\",\r\n  \"ui.tui.configShared\": \"Shared with GUI / WebUI; changes save immediately\",\r\n  \"ui.webui.start\": \"Start WebUI\",\r\n  \"ui.webui.stop\": \"Stop WebUI\",\r\n  \"ui.webui.running\": \"Running: {url}\",\r\n  \"ui.webui.stopped\": \"WebUI is stopped; backend sessions can keep running\",\r\n  \"ui.webui.backendStatus\": \"Backend PID {pid} · {clients} browser / Remote connections\",\r\n  \"ui.webui.passwordFailed\": \"Could not save the password\",\r\n  \"ui.webui.invalidPort\": \"Port must be an integer from 1024 to 65535\",\r\n  \"ui.webui.needTotp\": \"Generate and verify a TOTP secret first\",\r\n  \"ui.webui.applying\": \"Applying…\",\r\n  \"ui.webui.verified\": \"Verified\",\r\n  \"ui.webui.invalidCode\": \"Incorrect verification code\"\r\n});\r\n\r\nObject.assign(EN_DICT._textMap, {\r\n  \"WebUI 与后台服务\": \"WebUI and backend service\",\r\n  \"GUI、TUI 和浏览器使用同一个后台，共享会话、工具和设置。关闭前端后，后台仍可继续任务。\": \"GUI, TUI and browser share one backend, sessions, tools and settings. Tasks can continue after a frontend closes.\",\r\n  \"使用 cibyp-webui 或别名-webui 可在后台启动；其他设备通过服务地址登录，也可在桌面的 Remote 模式连接。\": \"Run cibyp-webui or alias-webui to start in the background. Other devices sign in at the service address or connect using desktop Remote mode.\",\r\n  \"监听范围\": \"Listen on\",\r\n  \"仅本机（127.0.0.1）\": \"This computer only (127.0.0.1)\",\r\n  \"所有网络接口（局域网 / 反向代理）\": \"All interfaces (LAN / reverse proxy)\",\r\n  \"连接地址使用这台电脑的 IP 或 HTTPS 反向代理域名；0.0.0.0 是监听地址。\": \"Connect using this computer’s IP address or HTTPS proxy domain; 0.0.0.0 is the listening address.\",\r\n  \"允许自动启动 WebUI\": \"Allow automatic WebUI startup\",\r\n  \"随任一前端启动后台时开启 WebUI\": \"Start WebUI when any frontend starts the backend\"\r\n});\r\n\r\nObject.assign(EN_DICT, {\r\n  \"ui.tor.hint\": \"Connect the native mobile App through a Tor onion service using the WebUI password and two-step verification. No public ports are required.\",\r\n  \"ui.tor.auto\": \"Connect Tor automatically with the backend\",\r\n  \"ui.tor.useBridges\": \"Use bridges\",\r\n  \"ui.tor.bridges\": \"Bridge configuration (one per line)\",\r\n  \"ui.tor.start\": \"Connect Tor\",\r\n  \"ui.tor.stop\": \"Stop Tor\",\r\n  \"ui.tor.getBridges\": \"Get bridges\",\r\n  \"ui.tor.stopped\": \"Tor disconnected\",\r\n  \"ui.tor.preparing\": \"Preparing Tor\",\r\n  \"ui.tor.connecting\": \"Connecting Tor\",\r\n  \"ui.tor.ready\": \"Tor connected\",\r\n  \"ui.tor.error\": \"Tor connection failed\"\r\n});\r\nObject.assign(EN_DICT._textMap, {\r\n  \"通过 Tor 洋葱服务连接原生手机 App，继续使用 WebUI 密码和两步验证。无需开放公网端口。\": \"Connect the native mobile App through a Tor onion service using the WebUI password and two-step verification. No public ports are required.\",\r\n  \"后台启动时自动连接 Tor\": \"Connect Tor automatically with the backend\",\r\n  \"使用网桥\": \"Use bridges\",\r\n  \"网桥配置（每行一条）\": \"Bridge configuration (one per line)\",\r\n  \"连接 Tor\": \"Connect Tor\",\r\n  \"停止 Tor\": \"Stop Tor\",\r\n  \"获取网桥\": \"Get bridges\",\r\n  \"Tor 未连接\": \"Tor disconnected\",\r\n  \"正在准备 Tor\": \"Preparing Tor\",\r\n  \"正在连接 Tor\": \"Connecting Tor\",\r\n  \"Tor 已连接\": \"Tor connected\",\r\n  \"Tor 连接失败\": \"Tor connection failed\"\r\n});\r\n\r\nObject.assign(EN_DICT._textMap, {\r\n  \"ui.update.installing\": \"Exiting to install the update\",\r\n  \"ui.update.launcherReady\": \"Update downloaded and verified. Run /update install to exit, then run your original launch command to use the new version.\",\r\n  \"ui.update.launcherConfirm\": \"Exit the shared backend? Run your original launch command again to use the downloaded update.\"\r\n});\r\n\r\nEN_DICT.ui.compaction = { running: 'Compacting context', done: 'Context compacted', error: 'Compaction failed · context preserved', skipped: 'No compaction needed', estimate: 'Token counts are estimates; the complete chat history is retained' };\r\nEN_DICT.ui.attachment = { unavailable: 'Attachment unavailable' };\r\nObject.assign(EN_DICT.ui.history ||= {}, { deleteWait: 'Wait for the current task to finish before deleting messages', deleteTurn: 'Delete turn', deleteTurnConfirm: 'Delete this turn and its raw context? Content already merged into a summary will remain.' });\r\n\r\nObject.assign(EN_DICT.ui.update ||= {}, { newReady: 'New version ready', verified: 'SHA-256 verified', restartHint: 'The download is ready. Restart the app when you are ready to install.', launcherHint: 'Safely downloaded. Exit the backend, then run your original command to use the new version.' });\r\n\nEN_DICT['ui.reasoning.requestSummary'] = EN_DICT.ui.reasoning.requestSummary;\nEN_DICT._textMap[\"请求推理摘要\"] = EN_DICT.ui.reasoning.requestSummary;\nEN_DICT['ui.reasoning.preserve'] = EN_DICT.ui.reasoning.preserve;\nEN_DICT._textMap[\"保留加密推理\"] = EN_DICT.ui.reasoning.preserve;\nEN_DICT['ui.reasoning.summaryHelp'] = EN_DICT.ui.reasoning.summaryHelp;\nEN_DICT._textMap[\"请求服务商提供的可读摘要，不额外调用模型。关闭不代表免除内部推理 Token 费用；兼容服务可能不支持此选项。\"] = EN_DICT.ui.reasoning.summaryHelp;\nEN_DICT['ui.reasoning.preserveHelp'] = EN_DICT.ui.reasoning.preserveHelp;\nObject.assign(EN_DICT, {\r\n  \"ui.tor.bridgeHint\": \"Supports obfs4, Snowflake, WebTunnel and meek. Both meek and meek_lite are accepted; url / front / targets parameters are preserved. Reconnect Tor after changes.\",\r\n  \"ui.tor.useMeek\": \"Use built-in meek bridge\",\r\n  \"ui.tor.meekSelected\": \"Meek bridge applied; select Connect Tor to start\",\r\n  \"ui.tor.address\": \"Remote connection address\"\r\n});\r\nObject.assign(EN_DICT._textMap, {\r\n  \"支持 obfs4、Snowflake、WebTunnel 和 meek。meek 与 meek_lite 均可填写，url / front / targets 参数会完整保留。修改后重新连接 Tor。\": EN_DICT['ui.tor.bridgeHint'],\r\n  \"使用内置 meek 网桥\": EN_DICT['ui.tor.useMeek'],\r\n  \"远程连接地址\": EN_DICT['ui.tor.address'],\r\n  \"已应用 meek 网桥，点击“连接 Tor”启动\": EN_DICT['ui.tor.meekSelected']\r\n});\r\nEN_DICT._textMap[\"默认关闭。开启后将服务商的加密推理与签名保存到聊天记录，并随 JSON / Markdown 导出。关闭后不再保存或导出这些数据；已有文件不会立即清除。当前工具轮次仍在内存中保留续接所需数据。加密数据不会显示为推理文本。\"] = EN_DICT.ui.reasoning.preserveHelp;\n\nObject.assign(EN_DICT, {\n  \"ui.systemOne.help\": \"Use yes/no, choice and score models for routing, tool selection and guards. Connect compatible System One cloud or local services; uncertain, timed-out or unsupported decisions fall back to the existing logic.\",\n  \"ui.systemOne.custom\": \"Custom / compatible local server\",\n  \"ui.systemOne.keyHint\": \"Provider API key; optional for local services\",\n  \"ui.systemOne.modelHint\": \"Select or enter a decision model ID\",\n  \"ui.systemOne.modelsUrl\": \"Model list URL (optional)\",\n  \"ui.systemOne.modelsHint\": \"Leave blank to use the provider model list\",\n  \"ui.systemOne.fetchModels\": \"Fetch decision models\",\n  \"ui.systemOne.endpointHelp\": \"Enter the complete decision endpoint URL. Cloudflare needs the account ID and model path; custom servers may omit the model. Fetching the list only sends GET requests, without running inference.\",\n  \"ui.systemOne.noul\": \"Supports yes/no decisions (noul)\",\n  \"ui.systemOne.choice\": \"Supports option selection (choice)\",\n  \"ui.systemOne.score\": \"Supports ordered scoring (score)\",\n  \"ui.systemOne.capHelp\": \"Disable unsupported types according to the model documentation. Confidence differs between models; reassess thresholds after changing the model.\",\n  \"ui.systemOne.usage\": \"Requests today: {calls}{limit} · Model {model}\",\n  \"ui.systemOne.serverDefault\": \"Server default\",\n  \"ui.systemOne.loadingModels\": \"Fetching decision models…\",\n  \"ui.systemOne.noModels\": \"No model list available; enter a model ID manually\",\n  \"ui.systemOne.modelsFound\": \"Found {count} decision models; select one in the model field\",\n  \"ui.systemOne.failure\": \"Failed: {error}\",\n  \"ui.systemOne.testing\": \"Testing…\",\n  \"ui.systemOne.connected\": \"Connected successfully\",\n  \"ui.systemOne.noResponse\": \"No response\"\n});\nObject.assign(EN_DICT._textMap, {\n  \"用「是否 / 选择 / 打分」决策模型处理路由、工具选择和护栏。支持兼容 System One 协议的云服务与本地服务；低置信、超时或能力不支持时回退原有逻辑。\": \"Use yes/no, choice and score models for routing, tool selection and guards. Connect compatible System One cloud or local services; uncertain, timed-out or unsupported decisions fall back to the existing logic.\",\n  \"自定义 / 本地兼容服务\": \"Custom / compatible local server\",\n  \"服务商的 API Key；本地服务可留空\": \"Provider API key; optional for local services\",\n  \"选择或输入决策模型 ID\": \"Select or enter a decision model ID\",\n  \"模型列表 URL（可选）\": \"Model list URL (optional)\",\n  \"留空自动使用服务商的模型列表\": \"Leave blank to use the provider model list\",\n  \"获取决策模型\": \"Fetch decision models\",\n  \"API URL 填完整的决策接口地址。Cloudflare 需包含 Account ID 和模型路径；自定义服务可不填模型。获取列表只发送 GET 请求，不调用模型。\": \"Enter the complete decision endpoint URL. Cloudflare needs the account ID and model path; custom servers may omit the model. Fetching the list only sends GET requests, without running inference.\",\n  \"支持是否判断（noul）\": \"Supports yes/no decisions (noul)\",\n  \"支持选项选择（choice）\": \"Supports option selection (choice)\",\n  \"支持档位打分（score）\": \"Supports ordered scoring (score)\",\n  \"按模型文档关闭不支持的类型，避免发送无效请求。不同模型的置信度并不等价，换模型后请重新评估阈值。\": \"Disable unsupported types according to the model documentation. Confidence differs between models; reassess thresholds after changing the model.\",\n  \"今日已调用: {calls}{limit} · 模型 {model}\": \"Requests today: {calls}{limit} · Model {model}\",\n  \"服务端默认\": \"Server default\",\n  \"正在获取决策模型…\": \"Fetching decision models…\",\n  \"服务商未提供模型列表，可手动输入模型 ID\": \"No model list available; enter a model ID manually\",\n  \"找到 {count} 个决策模型，可在模型框中选择\": \"Found {count} decision models; select one in the model field\",\n  \"失败: {error}\": \"Failed: {error}\",\n  \"测试中…\": \"Testing…\",\n  \"连通正常\": \"Connected successfully\",\n  \"无响应\": \"No response\"\n});\n\nObject.assign(EN_DICT._textMap, {\n  \"添加到模型池的 ChatGPT 模型\": \"ChatGPT model to add to the pool\",\n  \"添加并设为默认\": \"Add and set as default\",\n  \"从当前账号的可用模型中选择，点击「添加并设为默认」加入模型池，供新会话使用；已有会话可用 /model 切换。\": \"Choose an available model for this account and click “Add and set as default” to use it in new chats. Use /model to change an existing chat.\",\n  \"已添加到模型池并设为默认；新会话将使用此模型\": \"Added to the model pool and set as default for new chats\",\n  \"当前登录方式未提供可读取的订阅额度；请在 ChatGPT 用量管理中查看和调整。这不影响使用模型。\": \"This login does not provide readable subscription limits. View and manage usage in ChatGPT; you can still use the models.\",\n  \"This login provides no readable subscription limits; view and manage usage in ChatGPT\": \"This login does not provide readable subscription limits. View and manage usage in ChatGPT; you can still use the models.\"\r\n});\r\nfor (const [key, value] of Object.entries(EN_DICT.ui.camera)) EN_DICT['ui.camera.' + key] = value;\r\nEN_DICT['ui.attachments.failed'] = 'Attachment import failed. Remove the attachment and choose it again.';\r\nEN_DICT['ui.workspace.unavailable'] = 'The workspace is unavailable';\r\nObject.assign(EN_DICT._textMap, {\r\n  '使用当前设备的摄像头，将照片添加到对话': EN_DICT.ui.camera.subtitle,\r\n  '摄像头': EN_DICT.ui.camera.device, '切换摄像头': EN_DICT.ui.camera.switch,\r\n  '重拍': EN_DICT.ui.camera.retake, '使用照片': EN_DICT.ui.camera.use,\r\n});\r\nObject.assign(EN_DICT._textMap, {\r\n  \"版本与更新\": \"Version and updates\",\r\n  \"正在读取版本…\": \"Reading version…\",\r\n  \"发行说明\": \"Release notes\",\r\n  \"此版本的新内容\": \"What’s new\",\r\n  \"更新偏好\": \"Update preferences\",\r\n  \"只检查版本信息，不自动安装。关闭后仍可手动检查。\": \"Checks version information without installing. Manual checks remain available when disabled.\",\r\n  \"后台下载更新\": \"Download updates in the background\",\r\n  \"默认关闭。启用后，在自动检查发现新版且后台任务空闲时下载；安装前仍需手动确认。下载可能使用较多流量。\": \"Off by default. Download new versions after automatic checks while tasks are idle. Installation always requires confirmation. Downloads may use considerable data.\",\r\n  \"下载更新\": \"Download update\",\r\n  \"重启安装\": \"Restart and install\"\r\n});\r\nObject.assign(EN_DICT, {\r\n  \"ui.update.sourceLauncher\": \"npm launcher\",\r\n  \"ui.update.sourceRelease\": \"Release installation\",\r\n  \"ui.update.sourceDev\": \"Development build\",\r\n  \"ui.update.available\": \"Update available\",\r\n  \"ui.update.managedHint\": \"Updates the application runtime without reinstalling the npm package. After verification, exit the backend and run your original command to activate the update.\",\r\n  \"ui.update.directHint\": \"Downloads the official installer with SHA-256 verification. Confirm installation when ready; npm is unnecessary. Browser actions update the connected desktop backend.\",\r\n  \"ui.update.devHint\": \"Development builds only check versions. Update the source or download an installer from the release page.\",\r\n  \"ui.update.exitActivate\": \"Exit and activate update\",\r\n  \"ui.update.lastChecked\": \"Last checked: {time}\"\r\n});\r\nObject.assign(EN_DICT, { 'ui.settings.trayAlways': 'On a desktop, GUI, TUI and WebUI show one shared tray after initialization. Open a frontend or quit the shared backend from its menu.' });\r\nObject.assign(EN_DICT._textMap, { '桌面环境中，GUI、TUI 和 WebUI 初始化完成后均显示托盘。可从托盘打开界面或退出共享后台。': EN_DICT['ui.settings.trayAlways'] });\r\nObject.assign(EN_DICT._textMap, {\r\n  '自动记忆': 'Automatic memory',\r\n  '启用自动记忆': 'Enable automatic memory',\r\n  '自动记住新信息': 'Remember new information automatically',\r\n  'Chat 模式自动记忆': 'Automatic memory in Chat',\r\n  'Code 模式自动记忆': 'Automatic memory in Code',\r\n  'Babe 模式自动记忆': 'Automatic memory in Babe',\r\n  '自然聊天，延续了解。自动记住长期偏好与持续事项，在相关的新会话中引用。': 'Chat naturally and build continuity. Remember lasting preferences and ongoing goals for relevant future conversations.',\r\n  '关闭后仅引用已有记忆。提取使用当前会话模型，产生少量额外用量，计入消费上限。': 'Turn this off to use existing memories only. Extraction uses the current conversation model, with a small additional usage charge counted toward your spending limits.',\r\n  '个人偏好可在 Chat 与 Code 间共享；项目事项仅用于相同工作区；Babe 记忆独立。临时会话、附件正文、工具输出和密钥不参与提取。': 'Personal preferences are shared between Chat and Code; project facts stay in their workspace; Babe memories stay separate. Temporary chats, attachment contents, tool outputs and credentials are excluded from extraction.',\r\n  '跨会话延续偏好与持续事项，可随时暂停、编辑或删除。': 'Carry preferences and ongoing goals across conversations. Pause, edit or delete them at any time.',\r\n  '记住的事': 'What is remembered',\r\n  '搜索自动记忆…': 'Search automatic memories…',\r\n  '搜索自动记忆': 'Search automatic memories',\r\n  '清空自动记忆': 'Clear automatic memories',\r\n  '与长期记忆和聊天记录分别保存。删除聊天不会自动删除这里的记忆；手动编辑的内容不会被自动覆盖。': 'Stored separately from long-term memory and chat history. Deleting a chat does not delete these memories. Manual edits are protected from automatic changes.',\r\n  '自动记忆暂不可用，请稍后重试': 'Automatic memory is unavailable. Please try again later.',\r\n  '正在整理记忆…': 'Organizing memories…',\r\n  '记忆已同步': 'Memories synced',\r\n  '没有匹配的记忆': 'No matching memories',\r\n  '了解，从对话开始': 'Understanding starts with a conversation',\r\n  '聊聊你的偏好或正在推进的事情，值得延续的信息会出现在这里。': 'Talk about your preferences or ongoing work. Useful details will appear here.',\r\n  'Babe 独立记忆': 'Babe memory',\r\n  '个人记忆': 'Personal memory',\r\n  '工作区记忆': 'Workspace memory',\r\n  '手动编辑 · 自动更新已锁定': 'Edited manually · protected from automatic updates',\r\n  '从对话中记住': 'Remembered from a conversation',\r\n  '编辑自动记忆': 'Edit automatic memory',\r\n  '记忆已在其他界面更新，请核对后再次保存': 'Memory changed in another frontend. Review it before saving again.',\r\n  '无法保存，请检查内容中是否包含敏感信息': 'Cannot save. Check whether the content includes sensitive information.',\r\n  '删除这条自动记忆？聊天记录将保留。': 'Delete this automatic memory? Chat history will be kept.',\r\n  '清空所有自动记忆？长期记忆和聊天记录将保留。': 'Clear all automatic memories? Long-term memory and chat history will be kept.',\r\n});\r\n\nObject.assign(EN_DICT._textMap, {\n  \"关系与共同经历\": \"Relationship and shared moments\",\n  \"同一个 TA，跨对话延续关系。好感、信任与熟悉慢慢积累，新的聊天不会重新认识。\": \"The same companion across conversations. Affection, trust and familiarity grow together; new chats continue your story.\",\n  \"关系成长\": \"Relationship growth\",\n  \"相处节奏\": \"Relationship pace\",\n  \"慢慢来\": \"Take it slowly\",\n  \"自然发展\": \"Natural development\",\n  \"轻松体验\": \"Relaxed experience\",\n  \"故事的起点\": \"Where your story starts\",\n  \"从认识开始\": \"Start by getting acquainted\",\n  \"已经是伴侣\": \"Already partners\",\n  \"仅首次建立或重新开始关系时生效。\": \"Applies only when starting or resetting the relationship.\",\n  \"聊天顶部显示好感数值\": \"Show affection in the chat header\",\n  \"关系档案独立保存。删除聊天不会清空关系；可以在这里编辑共同记忆或重新开始。关系整理随回复完成，不另外请求模型。\": \"The relationship is stored separately from chats. Edit shared memories or start over here. Updates accompany replies without a separate model request.\",\n  \"重新开始关系\": \"Start a new relationship story\",\n  \"首次建立或重置关系时使用；新对话会继承当前关系\": \"Used when starting or resetting; new chats inherit the current relationship\",\n  \"兴趣与喜好\": \"Interests and preferences\",\n  \"相处边界\": \"Relationship boundaries\",\n  \"初识\": \"First meeting\",\n  \"渐渐熟悉\": \"Getting acquainted\",\n  \"知心朋友\": \"Close friends\",\n  \"心意渐近\": \"Growing closer\",\n  \"约会中\": \"Dating\",\n  \"彼此承诺\": \"Committed partners\",\n  \"平静自在\": \"Calm and at ease\",\n  \"有点开心\": \"Feeling cheerful\",\n  \"心里暖暖的\": \"Feeling touched\",\n  \"需要一点理解\": \"Needs understanding\",\n  \"关系暂不可用\": \"Relationship unavailable\",\n  \"关系成长已暂停\": \"Relationship growth paused\",\n  \"你们的故事\": \"Your story together\",\n  \"相处天数\": \"Days together\",\n  \"好感\": \"Affection\",\n  \"信任\": \"Trust\",\n  \"熟悉\": \"Familiarity\",\n  \"可以聊聊彼此的心意了\": \"Ready to talk about your feelings\",\n  \"慢慢了解，一起靠近\": \"Get to know each other, one step at a time\",\n  \"亲近来自真诚交流、信任与共同经历；关系升级需要彼此明确确认。\": \"Closeness grows through honest conversation, trust and shared moments. Each new commitment requires mutual agreement.\",\n  \"共同记住的事\": \"Shared memories\",\n  \"从一段真诚的对话开始，值得珍惜的经历和约定会留在这里。\": \"Start with an honest conversation. Meaningful moments and promises will be remembered here.\",\n  \"共同经历\": \"Shared moments\",\n  \"小小约定\": \"Promises\",\n  \"彼此偏好\": \"Preferences\",\n  \"关系已在其他界面更新，请刷新后重试\": \"The relationship changed in another frontend. Refresh and try again.\",\n  \"无法保存这条共同记忆\": \"Cannot save this shared memory\",\n  \"删除这条共同记忆？聊天记录将保留。\": \"Delete this shared memory? Chat history will be kept.\",\n  \"重新开始这段关系？关系进度、里程碑和共同记忆将清空，聊天记录与自动记忆保留。\": \"Start over? Relationship progress, milestones and shared memories will be cleared. Chats and automatic memories will be kept.\",\n  \"虚拟约会\": \"Imagined date\",\n  \"文字小游戏\": \"Word game\",\n  \"共同小目标\": \"Shared goal\",\n  \"我们一起构思一次虚拟约会吧，选一个你也喜欢的地点。\": \"Let’s imagine a date together, somewhere you would enjoy too.\",\n  \"一起玩一个你喜欢的文字小游戏吧，你先介绍规则。\": \"Let’s play a word game you enjoy. Tell me the rules.\",\n  \"我们来定一个这周可以一起坚持的小目标吧。\": \"Let’s choose a small goal to work on together this week.\",\n  \"编辑共同记忆\": \"Edit shared memory\",\n  \"发送 Agent 消息\": \"Send Agent message\",\n  \"列出子代理\": \"List subagents\",\n  \"停止子代理\": \"Interrupt subagent\"\n});\n\r\nObject.assign(EN_DICT._textMap, {\"查看协作 Agent\": \"View collaborating Agents\", \"中断子代理\": \"Interrupt subagent\", \"兴趣与生活设定\": \"Interests and everyday life\", \"相处偏好与边界\": \"Relationship preferences and boundaries\", \"TA喜欢什么、有什么自己的小习惯…\": \"Interests and personal habits…\", \"喜欢怎样的相处，不喜欢什么…\": \"Preferred ways of interacting and things to avoid…\"});\r\n\nObject.assign(EN_DICT, Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(EN_DICT.ui.remoteDevices).map(([key, value]) => ['ui.remoteDevices.' + key, value])));\nObject.assign(EN_DICT._textMap, Object.fromEntries(Object.entries({\"title\":\"Remote 设备\",\"hint\":\"Micro 主动连接当前后台。设备仅获得下方明确授予的工具和资源权限。\",\"refresh\":\"刷新设备\",\"pair\":\"配对 / 修改权限\",\"id\":\"设备 ID\",\"add\":\"添加工具授权\",\"save\":\"保存设备\",\"private\":\"新凭据仅在当前启动期间可取回。请通过可信 USB / 串口配置到设备，勿发送给 Agent。\"}).map(([key, source]) => [source, EN_DICT.ui.remoteDevices[key]])));\n\nEN_DICT['ui.remoteDevices.authorizedTools'] = \"Authorized tools\";\n","de.js":"/*\r\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later\r\n * Copyright (c) 2026 B5-Software\r\n *\r\n * This file is part of Could I Be Your Partner.\r\n *\r\n * German (de) translations for UI, tool descriptions, and system prompts.\r\n */\r\n\r\nconst DE_DICT = {\r\n\r\n// ── UI Strings ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\nui: {\n  remoteDevices: {title: 'Remote-Geräte', hint: 'Micro verbindet sich mit diesem Backend. Nur ausdrücklich freigegebene Werkzeuge und Ressourcen sind erlaubt.', refresh: 'Geräte aktualisieren', pair: 'Koppeln / Berechtigungen ändern', id: 'Geräte-ID', add: 'Werkzeug freigeben', save: 'Gerät speichern', private: 'Neue Zugangsdaten sind nur während dieses Backend-Starts abrufbar. Über vertrauenswürdiges USB / seriell übertragen, nicht an einen Agent senden.', tool: 'Werkzeugname, z. B. gpio_write', resources: 'Ressourcen, z. B. gpio:17 (kommagetrennt)', write: 'Schreiben erlauben (Genehmigung und Lease erforderlich)', remove: 'Entfernen', empty: 'Keine gekoppelten Geräte', online: 'Online', offline: 'Offline', writable: 'Schreibbar', edit: 'Berechtigungen ändern', revoke: 'Gerät widerrufen', confirmRevoke: 'Zum Bestätigen erneut klicken', duplicate: 'Werkzeugnamen müssen eindeutig sein', saved: 'Gespeichert. WSS-Gateway und neue Zugangsdaten am Gerät konfigurieren.', unavailable: 'Dieses Backend unterstützt keine Remote-Geräte'},\r\n  terminal: { error: 'Terminalaktion fehlgeschlagen: {error}' },\r\n  camera: {\r\n    title: 'Foto aufnehmen', subtitle: 'Ein Foto mit der Kamera dieses Geräts zum Gespräch hinzufügen',\r\n    device: 'Kamera', starting: 'Kamera wird verbunden…', secure: 'Kamerazugriff erfordert HTTPS oder localhost. Zuerst eine sichere Verbindung verwenden.',\r\n    denied: 'Kamerazugriff wurde verweigert. In den Browser- oder Systemeinstellungen erlauben und erneut versuchen.', missing: 'Keine Kamera verfügbar.',\r\n    retry: 'Erneut versuchen', retake: 'Neu aufnehmen', cancel: 'Abbrechen', use: 'Foto verwenden', capture: 'Aufnehmen', switch: 'Kamera wechseln',\r\n  },\r\n    reasoning: {\n  \"summary\": \"Denkzusammenfassung\",\n  \"text\": \"Denkprozess\",\n  \"requestSummary\": \"Denkzusammenfassungen anfordern\",\n  \"preserve\": \"Verschlüsselte Denkprozesse behalten\",\n  \"summaryHelp\": \"Lesbare Anbieterzusammenfassungen ohne zusätzlichen Modellaufruf anfordern. Ausschalten verhindert 